        <body>
            <div xml:id="d633-a1">

                <pb facs="0781" n="673" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg673"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Marquis Rudini to Baron Fava</hi>.</head>
                <p>In view of our discreet and legitimate demands, I can not admit further delay. An
                    immediate solution is indispensable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rudini</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
